{"id":"869d1b6ed24b3a9d","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-language.md","title":"Language bridge","display":"df-language — Language bridge","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-language","aliases":["72-df-language"],"display":"df-language — Language bridge","depends_on":["[[72-df-first-order-language]]","[[72-df-first-order-formula]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Local bridge; required interfaces reconstructed within book 72","verification_status":"reviewed-definition","proof_status":"definition-well-defined","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-language"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-language</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-language — Language bridge"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"111292e5b427d35c\" href=\"?note=111292e5b427d35c\" title=\"72-df-first-order-language\">72-df-first-order-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2c943d760d42086b\" href=\"?note=2c943d760d42086b\" title=\"72-df-first-order-formula\">72-df-first-order-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Local bridge; required interfaces reconstructed within book 72"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed-definition"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"definition-well-defined"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L=\\langle R,F,C,a\\rangle\">\\(L=\\langle R,F,C,a\\rangle\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"111292e5b427d35c\" href=\"?note=111292e5b427d35c\" title=\"72-df-first-order-language\">72-df-first-order-language</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(L)\">\\(\\operatorname{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(L)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FormulaSignatureOf}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{FormulaSignatureOf}_S\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"111292e5b427d35c\" href=\"?note=111292e5b427d35c\" title=\"72-df-first-order-language\">72-df-first-order-language</a> 的四元到五元转换。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{72}:=L,\\qquad\\Sigma_{72}:=\\operatorname{FormulaSignatureOf}_S(L)=\\langle C,F,a\\restriction F,R,a\\restriction R\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal L_{72}:=L,\\qquad\\Sigma_{72}:=\\operatorname{FormulaSignatureOf}_S(L)=\\langle C,F,a\\restriction F,R,a\\restriction R\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>此文件保留原有桥接定义的数学内容，仅统一72内部文件名及依赖接口。原压缩包未附外部第58本书正文；所需缺失接口已在72内部按调用语境重建。文件头中历史来源定位不是本次机器证明或对未提供正文的读取记录。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"111292e5b427d35c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-first-order-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-first-order-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2c943d760d42086b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-first-order-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"111292e5b